...
END_METHOD
```

But typical PLC programming: we define function block with code inside; the code is executed each time the FB is called (in ST we can write the logic directly after VAR declarations). The code will be executed each scan when the FB is invoked.

In some languages, you need to put the code inside a method like `PROGRAM` or `METHOD`. But here they just ask for code block. We can write the logic after VAR.

